OL,3,AZelensky says he expects war to
OL,4,Acontinue into winter after talks with
OL,5,AUS envoys
OL,6,
OL,7,FUkrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky
OL,8,Fhas said he expects the war with Russia
OL,9,Fto continue into the winter, following
OL,10,Ftalks with Donald Trump's top envoys in
OL,11,FKyiv.
OL,13,FThe initial discussions finished
OL,14,Fwithout an announcement of a major
OL,15,Fbreakthrough, after Steve Witkoff and
OL,16,FJared Kushner travelled to Ukraine for
OL,17,Fthe first time since Russia's
OL,18,Ffull-scale invasion. The previous day,
OL,19,Fthe pair had held talks with Vladimir
OL,20,FPutin in Moscow.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
